        'rawContent': 'The Juns are a [[human]] [[race]] native to [[Junheim]]. They have cross-bred with the [[Reigens]] for centuries.\r\n\r\n===Appearance===\r\n\r\nJuns average about 1.7 meters in height. They tend to be muscular and well-toned.\r\n\r\n====Skin Tone====\r\n\r\nJuns have slightly lighter skin tones, which have been darkened by their shared genetic stock with the [[Reigens]].\r\n\r\n====Hair Color====\r\n\r\nJuns have dark or light brown hair.\r\n\r\n===Lifespan===\r\n\r\nThe average Jun lifespan is 80 to 100 years.\r\n\r\n===Behavior===\r\n\r\n[[Category:Humans]]\r\n[[Category:Reigess Suverände]]'
